/**
 * @defgroup optimization_ga Genetic Algorithm (GA)
 * Generic genetic algorithm: instance, population and chromosomes, fitness
 * strategies (direct or PROMETHEE) and listeners.
 *
 * @defgroup optimization_gga Grouping Genetic Algorithm (GGA)
 * Groups, heuristics (first-fit) and operators of the grouping genetic
 * algorithm.
 *
 * @defgroup optimization_nngga Nearest-Neighbors GGA (NNGGA)
 * Grouping genetic algorithm based on the nearest neighbors of the objects.
 *
 * @defgroup optimization_sgga Similarity-based GGA (SGGA)
 * Grouping genetic algorithm based on the similarities between the objects.
 *
 * @defgroup optimization_hga Hierarchical Genetic Algorithm (HGA)
 * Trees of nodes containing objects.
 *
 * @defgroup optimization_ga2d 2D Placement Genetic Algorithm (GA2D)
 * Objects, nets, layouts and placement heuristics (bottom-left, edge,
 * center).
 *
 * @defgroup optimization_multicriteria Multi-criteria Decision
 * PROMETHEE method and 2-additive Choquet integral.
 */
